### Admin Verification — List PENDING
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/verifications?status=PENDING&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{curatorToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Admin Verification — Get dossier detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/verifications/{{associationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{curatorToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Admin Verification — Registry pre-check (informational only)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/verifications/{{associationId}}/registry-precheck
Authorization: Bearer {{curatorToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Admin Verification — Approve dossier
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/verifications/{{associationId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{curatorToken}}

###

### Admin Verification — Reject dossier
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/verifications/{{associationId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{curatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Document illisible. Veuillez soumettre une version plus nette."
}
